ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Oye, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
¡Gracias por hacerme compañía
mientras acampaba por aquí!
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Como me lo pasé tan bien,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
¡he decidido mudarme aquí!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Quiero conocer a todo el mundo
del pueblo,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:001B:}}pero antes tengo que
sacar mis cosas.
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}¡Deberías venir a verme mañana,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ehilà, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Grazie per aver trascorso un po'
di tempo con me durante
il mio soggiorno in campeggio!
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Mi hai fatto divertire un mondo!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Ecco perché ho deciso
di traslocare qui!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Non vedo l'ora di conoscere
tutti gli abitanti della città.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Prima però volevo disfare le valigie.
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Magari torna domani con più calma,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hallo, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Es war so nett mit dir bei meinem
letzten Campingurlaub hier,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}dass ich einfach hergezogen bin!
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Ich freu mich schon darauf,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} meine
neuen Nachbarn kennenzulernen.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Aber erst muss ich noch auspacken.
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Komm doch morgen wieder vorbei,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¡Ah, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Seguro que crees que estoy
por aquí otra vez de acampada.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Pues no!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Esta vez no!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} ¡Me he
lanzado y me he mudado aquí!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}
Desde ahora, ¡somos vecinos!
Ya nos veremos por el pueblo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Oh, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Scommetto che pensi che sia
tornato qui a campeggiare!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Nient'affatto!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Questa volta no!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Ho deciso di trasferirmi qui!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}D'ora in poi saremo vicini!
Ci vediamo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hallihallo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Erinnerst du dich noch an mich?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Ich bin {{TAG:0005:0001:}} aus {{TAG:0011:0002:0000}}.
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ich hab gerade sowieso über einen
Umzug nachgedacht,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}} als du mich
hierher eingeladen hattest.
Und wie du siehst,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} bin ich nun hier.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Wir sind also ab jetzt Nachbarn,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Schön,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} oder?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ciao, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Mi chiamo {{TAG:0005:0001:}} e{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} mi sono
appena trasferito in città.
In realtà ci siamo conosciuti mentre
ero qui in campeggio.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}Ti ricordi?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Mi avevi suggerito tu di trasferirmi!
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}O forse ho capito male?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Ad ogni modo,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ora sono qua!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ci vediamo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} vicin{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}!

{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Ehilà!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ti ricordi di me?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sono {{TAG:0005:0001:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ero venuto
a campeggiare da voi tempo fa!
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}E tu mi avevi detto:{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
"Ma perché non vieni a vivere qui?"{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
È andata proprio così, no?!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Comunque sia, eccomi qui.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Abbiamo un sacco di cose
di cui parlare, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Da ist ja {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ich bin's, dein Freund {{TAG:0005:0001:}}
aus {{TAG:0011:0002:0000}}!
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Nach deiner Einladung hab ich ein
bisschen überlegt und bin dann
wirklich hierhin umgezogen.
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Ich kann's noch gar nicht glauben,
dass wir jetzt Nachbarn sind,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hallo,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Wer bin ich wohl?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Na,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0001:}} natürlich!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Wir haben
uns in {{TAG:0011:0002:0000}} getroffen.
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Damals hast du mich eingeladen,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
hierherzuziehen.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Weißt du noch?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Tja,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} und jetzt bin ich da!
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Ich finde es total aufregend,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} in einer
neuen Stadt zu wohnen.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}} Lass uns
bald mal was unternehmen!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}Ooo!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Sonunda seni buldum,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0027:}}Buraya
kamp yapmaya geldiğim zamanı
hatırlıyor musun? Sen de bana böyle,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
'Hey, buraya taşınsana!' demiştin.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Hatırladın mı?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0021:}}Ben de aynen öyle
yaptım! Aslında{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} bir süredir buradayım.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sonunda konuşabildiğimize
sevindim.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Artık komşuyuz,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} görüşürüz,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}¡No puede ser!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
¡Soy yo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Tu invitación fue el motivo de que
me mudase aquí,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} pero luego al venir
no te encontré por ningún sitio.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Llegué a pensar{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} que quizá me había
mudado a un pueblo equivocado.{{TAG:0003:0005:}}
¡Qué alivio que al fin te veo!
Supongo que te veré un montón
ahora que somos vecinos,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Encantado de conocerte!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Me llamo {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:000F:}}¡Oye!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¿Conoces a {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}}?
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Cuando estaba de acampada,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} me invitó a mudarme
a tu pueblo, ¡y por eso estoy aquí!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Parece que ahora tú y yo somos
vecinos!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Ya nos veremos por ahí,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Tanıştığımıza memnun oldum!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Adım {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Hey!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}}'ı tanıyor musun? {{TAG:0003:0005:}}Kamp
yaparken{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}}
beni sizin kasabaya taşınmaya çağırdı;
ben de bu yüzden buradayım! {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Demek
artık komşuyuz!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Görüşürüz,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Howdy!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I'm {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}When I was camping here before,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} invited me to live here!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}So that's what I decided to do!
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Do you think {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} will be
surprised?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Anyway, since we're neighbors now,
I hope I'll be seeing lots of you,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Ehilà!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Sono {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Mentre ero qui in campeggio,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} mi ha proposto
di trasferirmi nella vostra città!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}E così ho deciso di seguire
il suo consiglio! {{TAG:0003:002B:}}Secondo te,
{{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} sarà sorpres{{TAG:000E:0008:00CD02006F000200610002003000}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Comunque sia, ora che siamo vicini
spero proprio di vederti in giro, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ehilà!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Mi chiamo {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Sai che {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} era venut{{TAG:000E:0008:00CD02006F000200610002003000}}
a trovarmi nella città in cui abitavo
prima, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Quando ho sentito parlare
di {{TAG:0005:0006:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} mi sono detto:
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}"Uau, sarebbe bello vivere lì!"
Beh, detto, fatto!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oggi disferò gli scatoloni,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
ma torna pure a trovarmi domani!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0005:0001:}}, piacere di conoscerti!
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Caspitina!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ti hanno mai detto che{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
assomigli {{TAG:000E:0010:}} {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}}?
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Mentre facevo campeggio qui,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} mi ha consigliato di{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
trasferirmi da voi e così ho fatto!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ora che siamo vicini, immagino
che ci vedremo spesso!
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ehilà!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Mi chiamo {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Sai che {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} era venut{{TAG:000E:0008:00CD02006F000200610002003000}}
a trovarmi nella città in cui abitavo
prima, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Quando ho sentito parlare
di {{TAG:0005:0006:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} mi sono detto:
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}"Uau, sarebbe bello vivere lì!"
Beh, detto, fatto!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oggi disferò gli scatoloni,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
ma vieni pure a trovarmi domani!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Huhu, ich bin {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Schön, dich kennenzulernen.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} hat mich überredet,
hier nach {{TAG:0005:0006:}} umzuziehen.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ich freu mich schon darauf, dich
besser kennenzulernen.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Äh, he he he,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}Dich kenn ich ja noch gar nicht!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ich heiße {{TAG:0005:0001:}} und bin gerade
erst hier eingezogen.
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ich war schon mal zum Campen hier.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Damals hat mir {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}}
vorgeschlagen, hierherzuziehen.
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Da hab ich mich nicht zweimal
bitten lassen.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Äh, he he he!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Man sieht sich,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Howdy!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I'm {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0011:0000:0000}}
suggested I leave my own town,
{{TAG:0011:0002:0000}}, and move here.
I've only been here a little bit, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}but I think I've done a pretty good
job of blending in, don't you think?
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}A huh huh huh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} It looks like we're
neighbors now.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0020:}}Good to meet you,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Cosa?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Abiti qui?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:000D:}}Caspitina,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
che gaffe!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} E io che pensavo di
aver già conosciuto tutti!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sono {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Sono venuto
a vivere qui perché me l'ha
consigliato {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Eh sì,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ormai abito qui da un pezzo.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Mi sono ambientato alla grande!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Magari uno di questi giorni andiamo
a farci un giretto insieme!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}È stato un piacere,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Ha?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Sen burada mı yaşıyorsun?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:000D:}}Off,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
kusura bakma!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Herkesle tanıştım
sanıyordum! {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ben {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} beni
çağırdığı için
burada yaşamaya başladım!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Tabii,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} aslında
bir süredir buradayım.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Evet, artık bayağı yerli sayılırım.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Seninle daha çok takılalım!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Tanıştığımıza sevindim,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¡Eh,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} encantado de conocerte!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
¡Soy {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Cuando me vine de acampada{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
conocí a {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} y {{TAG:000E:0008:00CD0400E9006C00080065006C006C00610002003000}}
me sugirió que me mudase aquí.
{{TAG:0003:0014:}}Parece que cuando me vine{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} también
me traje este catarro.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} En cuanto
me cure,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} a ver si hablamos un poco.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Nice to meet you!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} I'm {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I moved here because {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}}
invited me.
{{TAG:0003:0014:}}Seems like when I moved,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I brought
this cold along with me.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Once I'm
better,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} we should totally hang out.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hallihallo!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ich komm aus {{TAG:0011:0002:0000}}
und bin gerade hier eingezogen.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Ach ja, und ich heiße {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Ich hab mal jemanden von hier aus
{{TAG:0005:0006:}} getroffen, und der sagte:{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
„Zieh doch her! Hier ist es lustig.“
Aber jetzt, wo ich extra umgezogen
bin,{{TAG:0003:0012:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}} ist der gar nicht mehr hier!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Mann...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} So eine Pleite!
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Aber was soll's!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}} Wenn ich schon mal
hier bin, sollte ich auch das Beste
daraus machen,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Also dann, auf gute Nachbarschaft!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Howdy!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I'm {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
I just moved here recently!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Back when I lived in {{TAG:0011:0002:0000}},{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
someone from here came to visit,
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}and they invited me to move here.
{{TAG:0003:0029:}}By the time I moved here, though,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
that person was already gone.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}It's a little sad, right?
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}It's OK, though.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I'm liking life here,
and {{TAG:0003:0005:}}I hope you and I can be friends!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
See you around,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}¡Hola!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Soy {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
¡Hace poco que me mudé aquí!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Cuando vivía en {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0011:0002:0000}},{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
alguien fue allí de visita y {{TAG:0003:000B:}}me invitó
a venir a vivir a vuestro pueblo.
{{TAG:0003:0029:}}Y cuando al fin me mudé,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡esa
persona ya no vivía aquí!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Qué palo, ¿no?
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Pero no importa.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Me está gustando
vivir aquí, ¡y {{TAG:0003:0005:}}espero que tú y yo
podamos ser amigos!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} ¡Nos vemos!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Ehilà!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Mi chiamo {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Mi sono trasferito qui da poco!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Quando abitavo {{TAG:000E:0010:}} {{TAG:0011:0002:0000}},{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
sono stato invitato a trasferirmi
in questa città.
{{TAG:0003:0029:}}Quando sono arrivato qui,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} però,
la persona che me l'aveva
consigliato aveva traslocato.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Che tristezza, vero? {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Beh, pace.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sono felice della mia scelta {{TAG:0003:0005:}}e spero
tanto che diventeremo amici!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Ciao,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Oh!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Aspetta un attimo, ma tu
abiti qui?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}} Io sono {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Mi sono trasferito da {{TAG:0011:0002:0000}}
un po' di tempo fa.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ho traslocato qui{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} su invito di una
persona che nel frattempo se n'è
andata da questo posto.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}È un vero peccato!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0013:}}Che tristezza!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} La mia vita
{{TAG:000E:0010:}} {{TAG:0005:0005:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} non è iniziata
nel migliore dei modi{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Ma non mi preoccupo!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Mi piace un sacco vivere qui.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Spero che diventeremo amici!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Ci vediamo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Howdy, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
It's {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Do you remember
me?
A huh huh huh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I bet you're
surprised to see me in {{TAG:0005:0005:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
We're neighbors now!
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}When I was camping here before,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} invited me to move here,
so here I am!
See you around,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Buenas, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Soy {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¿Me recuerdas?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}¡Je, je, je!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Seguro que no
esperabas verme en {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Pues ahora somos vecinos!
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Cuando estuve aquí de acampada,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} me invitó a mudarme a
vuestro pueblo, ¡así que aquí estoy!
¡Hasta luego,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

