EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hi there, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Remember me?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I'm {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}When I was camping here before, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
somebody came up to me{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} and said,
