so I'm going to enjoy myself.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}It was good to see you again!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
See you later,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Selam, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Beni hatırladın
mı?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ben {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Daha önce burada kamp
yaparken {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}biri
yanıma gelip{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} 'Buraya taşınmalısın!'
dedi.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Ben de taşındım. {{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ama şimdi{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
galiba o kişi artık burada bile
yaşamıyor. {{TAG:0003:000C:}}Demek birbirimizi kıl payı
