EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hi there, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Long time no see.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} It's me,
{{TAG:0005:0001:}}!
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}When I was camping here before, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
somebody came up to me{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} and said,
"You should move here!"{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} So I did.
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}But now{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} it looks like that person
doesn't even live here anymore.
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}We must've just missed each other!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh well.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I'm in a new town now,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
so I'm going to enjoy myself.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Let's plan to hang out a lot, OK?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I'll see you around,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Hola, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Cuánto tiempo!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Soy yo, {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Cuando estuve aquí acampado,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
alguien vino y me dijo:{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} "¡Deberías
mudarte aquí!".{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Así que le hice caso.
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Pero ahora{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} por lo que se ve esa
persona ya no vive aquí. {{TAG:0003:000C:}}¡Ha debido
de irse poco antes de que viniera!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bueno...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Qué se le va a hacer. Yo
ahora estoy en un nuevo pueblo,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡y pienso pasármelo bien!
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Oye, tú y yo tenemos que vernos
un montón, ¿eh?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Hasta luego,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Selam, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Uzun zaman oldu.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Benim, {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Daha önce burada kamp yaparken {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}biri
yanıma gelip{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} 'Buraya taşınmalısın!'
dedi.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Ben de taşındım. {{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ama şimdi{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
galiba o kişi artık burada bile
yaşamıyor. {{TAG:0003:000C:}}Demek birbirimizi kıl payı
kaçırdık! {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Neyse.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Yeni bir kasabadayım,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
keyfini çıkaracağım.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Bol bol takılalım, tamam mı?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Görüşürüz,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Dur.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Sen {{TAG:0005:0008:}} değil misin?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ben
{{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Buraya
yeni taşındım!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0014:}}Ama{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} galiba soğuk algınlığımı da
yanımda getirdim.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}Üstüne,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} buraya
taşınmamı öneren kişi var ya? Meğer{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
artık burada yaşamıyormuş.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:000C:}}Off,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
sürekli takılırız sanmıştım. Bu
taşınma hiç doğru gitmedi.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:000D:}}İyileşince
takılacağımıza söz ver, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}! {{TAG:0003:001E:}}Hap{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}ŞUU!{{TAG:0007:0000:3C000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Neyse, seni yeniden görmek güzeldi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
Halt!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}Bist du nicht {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ich bin's, dein Freund {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Bin gerade erst hier eingezogen.
{{TAG:0003:0014:}}A-a-aber diese blöde Erkältung
macht mich noch ganz fertig...{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Und das ist noch nicht alles!
Die Person, die mich eigentlich nach
{{TAG:0005:0006:}} eingeladen hatte, wohnt
